  Electrostatic Interaction:            -0.197745182335808         -5.3809          -124.09          -519.18
 (Electrostatic Interaction =
  Delta V_elstat in the BB paper)
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Steric Interaction:              0.095980371769530          2.6118            60.23           252.00
 (Total Steric Interaction =
  Delta E^0 in the BB paper)

